[0.000, "o", "relish netboot: serving on lan0 (10.42.0.1) for 1h; Ctrl-C stops it\r\n  x86_64: OS 2026.41.133, 12 files checked; PXE boots ipxe-x86_64.efi (TFTP, iPXE's snp build), then http://10.42.0.1:8080/x86_64/installer.efi\r\n  answering only 52:54:00:00:00:01, 52:54:00:00:00:02, 52:54:00:00:00:03\r\n  no terminal to ask on: a disk that isn't blank is left alone unless --wipe lists its machine\r\n"]
[0.183, "o", "\u001b[2m# done after 6 s\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m# Power on the three machines (three QEMU VMs here).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
