[0.034, "o", "Back up /home/operator/lab/secrets: it holds the master key and the sealed root CA key, and `relish council recover` needs them if the cluster ever loses its quorum. Keep them somewhere safe off this machine, such as your password manager.\r\n(--yes: not waiting for you to confirm the backup)\r\n"]
